 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "p1",
   "at": 0.7,
   "text": "At VP and C, A.I. is already at work."
  },
  {
   "id": "p2",
   "at": 3.6,
   "text": "A hundred and ten million euros of value. | One hundred percent sourcing adoption. | And more than five hundred ideas, from you."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa1",
   "at": 12.4,
   "text": "And here's what's coming next. | It starts with learning: | Prompt Academy."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa2",
   "at": 17.2,
   "text": "Follow guided learning paths."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa3",
   "at": 20.6,
   "text": "Practise on real procurement tasks."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa4",
   "at": 24.3,
   "text": "Get scored on every prompt."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa5",
   "at": 31.4,
   "text": "And watch your skills grow."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa6",
   "at": 34.2,
   "text": "Coming in January."
  },
  {
   "id": "ava1",
   "at": 37.3,
   "text": "Teams ask hundreds of procurement questions every day. | The answers are buried in documents."
  },
  {
   "id": "ava2",
   "at": 43.6,
   "text": "Ask Ava answers in seconds. | Ask how to raise a purchase order, | and it walks you through it, step by step, | citing the approved sources."
  },
  {
   "id": "neg1",
   "at": 55.3,
   "text": "Who do we push? | How much leverage do we have? | The answers are scattered across RFPs, bids and reports."
  },
  {
   "id": "neg2",
   "at": 62.8,
   "text": "The Sourcing Negotiation Agent builds the briefing in minutes: | every bid scored, | and one clear recommendation, | so you walk into every negotiation fully briefed."
  },
  {
   "id": "hw1",
   "at": 73.3,
   "text": "Every hardware renewal comes down to one question: | what should this cost, today?"
  },
  {
   "id": "hw2",
   "at": 78.6,
   "text": "D to C Product Re-costing finds the model, | and re-costs it against the latest data, | in seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "sw1",
   "at": 89.3,
   "text": "For software services, | the price usually starts with the supplier's quote."
  },
  {
   "id": "sw2",
   "at": 94.0,
   "text": "D to C Should Cost flips that. | Pick the project, the complexity and the market, | and get a defensible range, | before the first quote arrives."
  },
  {
   "id": "obl1",
   "at": 105.3,
   "text": "Every contract makes promises. | But checking them is manual, | so broken promises rarely become claims."
  },
  {
   "id": "obl2",
   "at": 112.8,
   "text": "Obligation Management checks every order against the contract, | flags the breach, | and calculates the claim, | so no value is left on the table."
  },
  {
   "id": "ex1",
   "at": 124.3,
   "text": "Before every supplier meeting, an executive gets a forty-page pack, | pulled from a dozen systems."
  },
  {
   "id": "ex2",
   "at": 130.6,
   "text": "Executive Supplier Intelligence puts it on one screen: | spend, risk, contracts and news. | And you can simply ask it."
  },
  {
   "id": "lk1",
   "at": 142.3,
   "text": "Getting answers from data usually means reports, | filters, | and exports."
  },
  {
   "id": "lk2",
   "at": 147.6,
   "text": "With Conversational Analytics in Looker, | just ask in plain English, | and get the chart, the table and the insight, in seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "dc1",
   "at": 160.1,
   "text": "Imagine procurement as a city. | Every category is a plot of land. | As teams adopt, their buildings grow. | Using the blueprint unlocks smart. | A.I. completes the journey: autonomous. | And the league shows who's leading."
  },
  {
   "id": "rd1",
   "at": 175.5,
   "text": "Thirty-four A.I. use cases, | in the next six months."
  },
  {
   "id": "rd2",
   "at": 181.4,
   "text": "And the next one | could be yours."
  },
  {
   "id": "mp1",
   "at": 186.4,
   "text": "Agent Marketplace. | Every agent, in one place."
  },
  {
   "id": "mp2",
   "at": 190.8,
   "text": "Anyone can contribute. | Try it, | rate it, | improve it."
  },
  {
   "id": "mp3",
   "at": 197.0,
   "text": "The best ideas are picked every month, to scale."
  },
  {
   "id": "mp4",
   "at": 202.2,
   "text": "Built by our people, | for our people."
  },
  {
   "id": "end1",
   "at": 206.2,
   "text": "The future won't happen to us. | We'll build it."
  }
 ]
}